window.products.push({"id":864117,"name":"Simply Bamboo 14\" X 5\" Matte Espresso Bamboo Bowl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Jm87xrCcL._AC_.jpg","description":"The inside of these finely crafted bowls showcase the beautiful natural pattern of laminated bamboo grasses and feature a food-safe, matte finish. The outside of each bowl is painted a semi-gloss espresso color, perfect for accessorizing fall and winter tables. Serving salads or snacks in these elegant bowls is sure to make an impression. These bamboo bowls also make an attractive table centerpiece. Measures 14\"(wide) by 5\"(high). *Care Instructions: This product is not suitable for the dishwasher. To clean, simply wash in warm, soapy water and towel dry. Do not allow bamboo products to soak in water. Rub with olive or vegetable oil to keep bamboo from drying out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Jm87xrCcL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Bamboo","source_asin":"B00HZWS3W8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HZWS3W8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HZWS3W8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":864118,"name":"BlueNatHxRPR 50+7.5 MFD uF CBB65 Capacitor Air Conditioner Capacitor Round Dural Motor Run Capacitor Withstand 450V AC","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IjME8kHbL._SL1080_.jpg","description":"Production Name: Air Conditioner Dural Capacitor Module Type: CBB65 High Capacity Metallized Polypropylene Capacitor Withstand Voltage: 450V AC Capacity Volume: 60+7.5 MFD uF Tolerance: +/-5% Working Temperature Range: -25℃/-13℉ - 70℃/158℉ Feet Pins: 3, H for condensor,F for cooling fan, C for common feet Terminal Size: 1/4 in Standard Terminal(6.3x0.8mm) Overview Size(with Feet):50*50*125mm/2.0*2.0*5.0in NetWeight:256 g/9.0oz Remark: 1.Safe first, unplug and power off, advise to wait for at least 1 minute to let capacitor to release high voltage 2.Please conform high voltage is already released, advise to use a nipper pliers to short capacitor foot and common foot to double conform release voltage,notice your hand needs to hold the insulated part of nipper pliers 3.The common phenomenon of air conditioner capacitor broken is that compressor can not start or moving strengthless 4.High withstand voltage capacitor can replace the low withstand voltage capacitor, such as 450V withstand capacitor can replace the 370V capacitor with same volume, yet the 370V can not replace the 450V capacitor. 5.Normally only samll power air conditioners used 250V AC capacitors which total power in is 125V, most home air conditioners capacitor used 330V 370V or 450V AC capacitors to provide more cooling air","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IjME8kHbL._SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueNatHxRPR","source_asin":"B07Q44Y63X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q44Y63X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q44Y63X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
