window.products.push({"id":864129,"name":"Lyacmy Moon and Star Tapestry Psychedelic Moon Space Tapestries Mountain Clouds Tapestry Black and White Tapestry for Room(51.2 x 59.1 inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZbsD9qffL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designer says: What a psychedelic moon and star tapestry! Combine elements of moon, star, clouds and starry night sky, will bring your room mysterious atmosphere. Click \"ADD TO CART\", get one for your room. Perfect Design: Moon and star tapestry with psychedelic atmosphere present us beautiful spectacular scenery. Make you enjoy nature landscape at home and spend the least money to decorate your room a new look. Premium Material: Psychedelic tapestry is made from 100% high quality polyester fabric, skin-friendly, non-toxic. Our space tapestry is also durable, lightweight, and soft. Hang it on wall with no worry. HD Printing: This Mountain tapestry use advanced HD printing technology with vivid colors and crisp lines, don't worry fadding. Multi Purpose: Black and white tapestry is suitable for four seasons. It can be a curtain, bed cover, sofa cover, picnic blanket and so on. You can use clouds tapestries for most indoor and outdoor activities. Easy to Hang: Hang this moon tapestry by pushpin, decorative tacks or hooks. You can easily fold and store when you don‘t use them. Size Detail: 51.2ʺ L × 59.1ʺ W (130cm * 150cm) 59.1ʺ L × 82.7ʺ W (150cm * 210cm) 70.9ʺ L × 92.5ʺ W (180cm * 235cm) Choose the suitable size you like. Wash and Care: Wash this wall hanging tapestry by machine or hand in cold water. Please iron at low temperature, hang dry, please don't bleach. Package Including: 1*Moon and Star Tapestry Warm Notice: Please allow a little color difference because computer display and light. 1-2cm/0.4” - 0.8” is allowed by manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZbsD9qffL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lyacmy","source_asin":"B085G8KVVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085G8KVVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085G8KVVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":864130,"name":"Wusthof 3-1/2-Inch Paring Knife, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21EKgCBGMBL._AC_.jpg","description":"This pink version of Wusthof's 3-1/2 Inch Paring Knife is helping to raise breast cancer awareness as part of Wusthof's partnership with Susan G. Komen for the Cure. For each pink paring knife sold, Wusthof is donating 10 percent of the retail price to the Susan G. Komen for the Cure foundation. Made with the same features and attention to detail as Wusthof's classic paring knife, it features full-tang and full-forged construction for remarkable balance and control. The hand-honed edges offer both razor sharpness and a long-lasting beveled edge. The triple riveted handle, in a lovely pastel pink, is comfortable and durable for quick and easy peeling, coring, cleaning, and cutting all kinds of fruits and vegetables. Made in Germany to exacting standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21EKgCBGMBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B0011YQR1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0011YQR1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0011YQR1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
