window.products.push({"id":864209,"name":"Meat Grinder Electric 2000W Stainless Steel Meat Mincer with 3 Grinding Plates and Sausage Stuffer for Home Use &Commercial ETL Approved","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aNMVLmz8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Note：Please check the two cutting plates, sausage attachment and kibbe attachment in the accessory box on the back of the machine. Never wash with water over 50° Celsius (122° F). Can't be washed in the dishwasher. Always dry after washing 1. Assemble the blade and cutter and twist on the cover before use 2. Never put in bones, skin, gluten, nuts, or other non-meat foods or materials 3. Don't run longer than 5 minutes continuously; allow the motor to cool off Considerate Design in Every Detail Flagup meat grinder provided all featured big gears and gearbox to prevent the pressures from grinding all types meats (beef and deer). This is most one of high quality appliances in the market, the meat grinder has featured with a circuit breaker to prevent motor burnout. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee Creating your own life in healthy way by making meatballs, sausages and flavorful burgers as easy as you can and as much as quickly as you want in your kitchen with our Flagup Meat Grinder! Specification Material: Metal, Plastic. Color: Black Item: Meat Grinder Package Size: 41 x 20 x 25 cm/16.1 x 7.9 x 9.8 inch N.W: 3.3 kg G.W: 3.7 kg Rated power: 500W Locking power: 2000W US standard voltage: 110-120V Three buttons: OFF/ON/R Quantity: 1Pcs Occasion: Home, etc. Package Content: 1 x Meat Grinder 1 x Food Pusher 1 x Hopper Plate 1 x Head and its accessories 1 x Instruction Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aNMVLmz8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homdox","source_asin":"B07JJZKL38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JJZKL38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JJZKL38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":864210,"name":"Oregon Scientific Radio-Controlled Projection Alarm Clock, Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510BG1R3XWL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Makes going to bed or waking up fun! Cool and colorful, this member of the ExactSet family has all the amazing atributes of our other ExactSet clocks: it sets itself automatically, self-corrects for daylight saving time, and projects the time in soft glowing red numbers on the wall or ceiling! Very fun, very accurate, very fresh. Now you can have ExactSet accuracy all the time! These cool and curvaceous clocks not only look good, but they are easy to use and operate. The radio tower icon on the LCD screen lets you know your ExactSet projection clock is tuned in and receiving the super-accurate Atomic Clock time. Colorful design and split-second accuracy -- a combination of style and technology that is unquestionable! AC adapter included. Amazon.com Translucent plastic, a fluid shape, and rubber feet give this clock a youthful appearance. Additional fun comes from the projection feature, which shines a digital image of the current time onto the ceiling of a dark room. The clock's two-line LCD displays the current time with seconds or calendar date, the alarm set time, and a small outline of the USA which allows time zone selection. Radio signals received from the U.S. atomic clock synchronize this calendar clock automatically. Pressing the snooze button activates for five seconds both the blue HiGlo backlight (a slight hum will be heard) and the projection feature. While the clock illuminates only when activated, keeping the room dark, the projection light can stay on all night when the included power adapter is plugged in. The crescendo alarm starts beeping gently, then builds in intensity. A snooze button gives the option of eight more minutes of sleep (and running for the bus). Measuring 4-1/2 by 4-1/4 by 2-1/4 inches, the clock comes with two AA batteries and a 90-day warranty against defects. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510BG1R3XWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oregon Scientific","source_asin":"B00006J03Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006J03Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006J03Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
