window.products.push({"id":864232,"name":"The Original McSir Mixing Pitcher - White, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z3T1asQBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to Clean - Unlike the others, our pitcher with mixer plunger has a straight minimalist shape that makes reaching all the corners of the container effortless. It is easier to clean than a regular juice jug - making it an excellent option for camping or outdoor activities. Great for mixing frozen juice concentrate, shakes, chocolate milk, powdered lemonade, fruit punches, iced tea, mixed drinks, protein shakes, baby formula and more! We have even used it to make pancake batter. No Spill, No Drip Spout - This dishwasher-safe beverage pitcher features a tightly fitting lid, so no drops of your favorite drink will spill. A multifunctional pitcher, it is also suited for children’s parties as it doubles as a kids juice pitcher. Measure guides on both sides of Pitcher Durable, Semi-Clear Pitcher - Made of thick plastic without BPA, this lemonade pitcher is long-lasting and excellent for everyday use. The translucent design of our mixing pitcher with lid gives you a clear view of what’s inside. Plus, there are several colors to choose from! 2 Qt. Capacity - 4 1/2\" Diameter x 9 1/4\" Height (11\" with Lid and plunger) Big Space, Great Serving - Serve a generous portion of any beverage with this 2 quart pitcher with lid. Measuring 4.75 x 4.75 x 11 inches, our juice pitcher is ideal for large quantities of water, iced tea, lemonade, and smoothies, iced coffee, and many more. Plunger with angled blades that force liguid around like a vortex to mix better Mix Drinks Conveniently - Our plastic pitcher comes with a plunger attached to the lid, making your favorite drink easy and quick to make. Smoothly mix and stir any kind of powder drink and frozen juice concentrate with this drink container. Made in the USA! Dishwasher Safe! Made with NSF (food safe) No BPA plastic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z3T1asQBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JBK Pottery","source_asin":"B08HKPFV54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HKPFV54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HKPFV54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
