window.products.push({"id":864250,"name":"VEVOR Bar Table and Chairs Set 47\" Pub Table Set with 4 Bar Stools Kitchen Dining Table and Chairs Set for 4 Iron Frame Counter Height Dining Sets for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":178.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xvAxeyZsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bar Table Set--Enjoy Your Modern Life5-Piece Set & Space Saving & Rustic StyleIf you are looking for a small and compact dining table for your place, this is what you are looking for. The wood grain finish of this 5-piece dining table looks old, classic, and never goes out of style. With its retro antique wood color panels and black iron frame, it's very sturdy and won't wobble. Not only can it be used at home, but also in bars, restaurants and other commercial establishments. Create the perfect aesthetic and set the mood right with VEVOR! key FeaturesMaximize Space UtilizationThe four bar stools fit perfectly under the table when not in use, maximizing space while maintaining aesthetics. This counter height dining sets will be a great addition to your living room or kitchen space.Use with ConfidenceOverall Table Dimensions: 47.2\"(L) x 23.6\"(W) x 35.4\"(H); Overall Stool Dimensions: 15.8\"(L) x 11.8\"(W) x 25.6\"(H). Overall table capacity: 220.5 lbs. Stool capacity: 220.5 lbs. The ergonomically designed height of the stool and the support frame under the stool provide a perfect place to set your feet so that you will not feel tired after sitting for a long time.Solid and DurableVEVOR's bar table set is made from thickened MDF with a sturdy iron frame that provides an industrial look while ensuring stability and long-lasting use. They are scratch-proof and easy to clean.Quick InstallationThe package contains all necessary accessories and detailed instructions. You can easily complete assembly within an hour, creating a spectacular dining space for enjoying delicious food with family or friends.Bar Table Set for 5This bar table set including one dining table and four high-quality bar stools in a rustic brown finish, you can enjoy drinking and partying with friends for years to come. Of course, it can also be used as a breakfast table to provide you with a comfortable dining environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xvAxeyZsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B0BRY1L4PH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRY1L4PH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRY1L4PH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
