window.products.push({"id":864486,"name":"Westinghouse True HEPA H13 Filter Replacement Compatible with 1701 and 1702 Model Air Purifiers (Set of 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xvLCBl0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MEDICAL GRADE TRUE HEPA FILTER: The H13 medical grade True HEPA filters 99.97% of airborne pollutants, dust, pollen, and other allergens as small as 0.3 microns. LONG LASTING AIR CLEANER FILTER: The true HEPA filter replacements can be used up to 3,000 hours (3-4 Months) of operation; an indicator light on the unit will let you know when it’s time to replace SAFE AND RELIABLE: No matter what season it is, these Westinghouse air filters can catch dust mites, pollen, and other allergens so you can breathe easy MODEL 1701 & 1903 REPLACEMENT: This air purifier HEPA filter is a replacement for the Westinghouse air purifier with NCCO technology models 1701 & 1903","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xvLCBl0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Westinghouse","source_asin":"B087V6KFB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087V6KFB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087V6KFB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":864487,"name":"Le Parfait Familia Wiss Terrine Wide Mouth French Glass Jar w/Airtight 2-Piece System Gold Lids | Ideal for Canning, Food Storage, Meal Prep, Cake Jar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7115vdY9PbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"HIGH-QUALITY GLASS JARS Le Parfaits 6-Packs of sturdy jars are made of quality glass to preserve foods flavor and keep the food fresh. Our 200ml jars have a wider opening than a regular mason jar. Putting food inside and taking it out is easy because of its wide opening. Get 6 pieces of premium French glass jars, each having its own 2-Piece system lids. DURABLE 2-PIECE LID SYSTEM We offer 1 sealing cap and 1 screw full lid that is USDA recommended. The inside of the screw lid has a concave curve in the middle while the sealing cap has the inverse of it. Our 2-lid system creates a uniform pressure around the outside of the rim which helps to achieve a vacuum in the canning process keeping your food secure and fresh. A better sealing system prevents you from wasting your time and money recreating your canning process. FITS YOUR HOME PANTRY This 200ml Familia Wiss Terrine has an easy-grip elegant design that fits your kitchen cabinets. A perfect glass container for baking essentials, and even for herbs and spices, making your pantry organized. Ideal freezer jar due to its straight upward body shape, make sure to leave some space on top for expansion while freezing. The best glass jar for homemade ice cream or any cold dessert that kids will surely enjoy. MULTI-PURPOSE PREMIUM JARS Full lids are used for dry goods storage and leftovers, while the sealing cap is used for canning and preserving food. Great containers for individual servings of breakfast or lunch on the go to school and office; your family will surely enjoy fresh food anytime and anywhere. This can also be used as a container for your bathroom and laundry storage, body washes, and other DIY crafts. SECURED PACKAGING Our packages are environmentally friendly and perfect for eco-conscious consumers. Jars are securely packed. Glass jars are reusable and created to higher European standards that fit your everyday healthy lifestyle needs. We offer a large range of various sizes and styles that are guaranteed premium glasses and lids. When cleaning, do not use steel brushes, use mild soap and dry it thoroughly before storing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7115vdY9PbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Parfait","source_asin":"B0C6P29755","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6P29755","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6P29755","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
