window.products.push({"id":864491,"name":"Multifunction Precision Electronic Digital 11 Lb/5 Kg Kitchen Scale in 1 G/0.05 Oz Graduation with Tare and Auto Off Function for Accurate Measuring P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gS1Bi+PjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ERIC Enterprises Multifunction Digital Kitchen Scale Description: The ERIC Enterprises Multifunction Digital Scale is stylish, elegant and highly accurate. A perfect tool for weighing of all kinds of small items or objects within the scales capacity. It has a capacity of up to 5000g / 11lb and professional accuracy of 1g / 0.05oz. What makes this versatile digital scale so convenient to use, is because it sets to 4 different modes of measurement to meet different needs. It is also small and lightweight to use and clean. It includes a Tare feature that calculates the net weight of the ingredients by subtracting the container weight to calculate the weight of the ingredients being weighed. It has an elegant stainless steel weighing platform. The back lit LCD display helps make the numbers easy to read and to help with its accuracy the scale is set on four textured stabilizing rubber feet that prevents any sliding. The display shows results in ounces, grams, milliliters and pounds and the large Unit button allows you to switch from one unit of measurement to another with a touch of the button. A must have tool for every modern kitchen so get yours today by ordering now. Your satisfaction is guaranteed by our 1 Year replacement warranty for any manufacturing defects Tips & Care: Complete list included in the packaging Functions: ~ Tare button, which allows you to subtract the weight of an empty container or tray for net weighing determination ~ Unit button, which allows you to change the measurement unit from grams to ounces to pounds to milliliters ~ Automatically powers off after inactivity of 70 seconds and includes 2x AAA batteries. Has Low Battery indicator and Overload display icons What’s in the box? ~ White case, Stainless Steel top Multifunction Digital Scale ~ Instructions on how to use and care for your new product ~ 2x AAA Batteries ~ Packing materials – please keep out of children’s reach and dispose of responsibly","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gS1Bi+PjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eric","source_asin":"B00H1B3CHO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H1B3CHO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H1B3CHO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
