window.products.push({"id":864603,"name":"Winter Fog Artwork by Dave MacVicar, 24 x 24\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7126oiS5MvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a black and white photograph of a winter landscape. Dave MacVicar is a Canadian photography who resides in Toronto, Canada. Dave's passion for photography was discovered when he purchased an entry level camera to capture video footage of his band. Soon after he began photographing anything and everything in his hometown. He began focusing on landscape as his primary focus. Dave's fascination with symmetry began to impact the evolution of his work. His traditional photographs were replaced by long exposure black and white images that covey a tranquil yet somewhat brooding feel. Dave is also been focusing on abstract architecture photographs in addition to his landscape and seascape work. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7126oiS5MvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B011OCF3EA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011OCF3EA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011OCF3EA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
