window.products.push({"id":864623,"name":"Chef Knife Sharpener –Kitchen Knife Sharpening Tool with 3-Stage for Any Type of Blades, and Ergonomically Designed Best Choice Knife Sharpening kit (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R7-vBsvyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Everyone Should Enjoy Cook! So it is important to find the effective Way to Sharpen Knives! Believe it or not, a dull knife is one of the most dangerous objects in your kitchen. When a blade isn’t sharp enough to properly cut food, it can easily slip from your control, nicking your hands or fingers. Our knife sharpener is best choice to you! Why Choose Our Knife Sharpener? - Innovative 3-step system- Fast and easy to use- Safety designed + Non-slip bottom- Made of ABS plastic and prime steel Features The 3-Step Knife Sharpening kits are designed to sharpen any dull or damaged knives and blades. Stage 1: diamond sharpening rod repairs and straightens damaged blades. Stage 2: slot sharpens to restore its V-shape.  stage 3 slot fine tunes for a final best polish. Knife Sharpening kit Details Color Black Our Prime Knife sharpener Packing Dimensions 8.2x2.9x1.9inches Weight 5.0 Ounces How Our Knife Sharpener Works: Stage 1 - Preparation (High grade Diamond rods). This 'roughens' the knife edge to prepare the surface for sharpening. It also smoothes any nicks and imperfections that could cause the blade to 'catch' during the sharpening stage (a common problem with 1 and 2 stage pull through sharpening slots which can cause damage to blades). Stage 2 - Sharpening (Hardened Tungsten Carbide Plates) - Now pull the blade through slot 2's precision angled tungsten carbide plates to create the perfect sharpened 'V' edge on even the bluntest knife. Stage 3 - Hone (Ceramic Stone Rods) - For final edge honing. It removes any burs and gently polishes the blade edges for a super sharp polish. Our Chef Knife Sharpener Advantages 1 Easy to use 2 Safety comes first 3 Beautiful Design with Premium Quality it’s strong, durable and designed to last a lifeti","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R7-vBsvyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N&L Home","source_asin":"B07D5Z8LJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D5Z8LJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D5Z8LJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":864624,"name":"Roylvan Christmas Star Tree Topper, Lighted Tree Topper with 6H Timer Battery Powered Decoration Topper Light, 20 LED Beaded Star Treetop for Indoor O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l+7wHoSOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Beaded Chritmas Star Tree Topper】 - Designed in a star shape with beaded, and wrapped with the LED string lights shining in attractive warm white, this hollowed-out star topper crowns your Christmas tree with shimmering elegance. With its clean, fine lines and three-dimensional design, this classic ornament adds an elegant and fancy touch to any Christmas decorating theme. 【Perfect Size】 - 9.84 x 2.36 x 11.81 inch / 25 x 6 x 30 cm (L*W*H). The ideal size for general Christmas trees, so you don't have to worry about it not fitting your Christmas tree. NOTE: Make sure the product is firmly installed on the top of the Christmas tree. 【Power Saving】 - Designed with the time control function, when you the switch to \"TIMER\", the bead will keep lighting for 6 hours. The LED lights are powered of 2 AA batteries and you have no need to install extra electric wire, which means it works great either indoor or outdoor. The battery pack case is included in the package but the batteries are Not. Pre-lit with 20 bright warm LED lights, which will outline the shape of the stars at night. 【Easy Installation】 - Comes with the 1 m / 3.3 ft cable is longer enough to make the star tree topper easy to connect without a ladder. Made of high-quality metal material, the cone spiral base can match perfectly with the top branches of your Christmas tree, which ensures the unique treetop attaches securely to your tree. Sturdy and safe, a quick and easy way to create the festival atmosphere for your space. 【A Perfect Decor】 - The wire is winded back and forth to form an intricate and beautiful tree topper with silver strips on surface, bringing you a warm and natural Christmas atmosphere. Perfect for home, office, store, restaurant, mall decoration. A fun and festive addition to any holiday and seasonal decor, suitable for Christmas theme party, Halloween, birthday, Thanksgiving, housewarming decoration and gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l+7wHoSOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Roylvan","source_asin":"B0BF9SMZ1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF9SMZ1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF9SMZ1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
