window.products.push({"id":864645,"name":"Amscan Candy Jar Plastic Container with Lid (Each) - Party Supplies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CuM4ur5XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Enjoy your snacks, sweets, and treats, and store them in a transparent food container. The cute slanted food storage for snacks seals out the air and preserves your candies' freshness while making your kitchen or dining look presentable. This novelty table accessory is a must-have food container for all types of goodies that will make it convenient for you to grab a piece of your candies. Serve and display your precious candy collection, or freshly baked cookies in a stylish glass dispenser. The transparent container allows you to see the goodies stored inside the jar. Perfect container for Halloween treats or party goodies. Novelty candy jar fits any kitchen accessory collection to celebrate any occasion hosting events, holidays, housewarmings, dates, weddings, or company events. Perfect gift for sweets and cookie lovers to keep their table organized and decorated with their delicious snacks and candies. The practical transparent design allows you to display your colorful goodies on any tabletop and make excellent decor for any kitchen and bar setting. A great gift for housewarming parties, weddings and any toast-worthy celebration! Includes 1 Plastic Candy Jar With Removable Lid, a transparent, slanted container for your favorite sweets and snacks. The round container has a transparent lid that seals the container. With its slanted form, it's easier to grab candies from the jar. Beautifully crafted plastic food container to hold any type of treats or snacks while providing an elegant table set up for your family. The round-shaped plastic container is a reusable, elegant jar for candies made of premium quality plastic materials, designed with a slanted opening and sealed by a transparent lid. A compact, sturdy, reliable craftsmanship candy jar with a fancy finish. The plastic candy jar is built with durable materials; a safe and effective container for candies, chocolates, cookies and other goodies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CuM4ur5XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"amscan","source_asin":"B012H6YVO0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012H6YVO0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012H6YVO0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
