window.products.push({"id":864651,"name":"Homedex 50\" Recessed Mounted Electric Fireplace Insert with Touch Screen Control Panel, Remote Control, 750/1500W, Log/Crystal Options","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":269.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LII6p81QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☀【Modern Home Decor】: The fireplace brings relaxation and comfort into the home, ideal for family room, bedroom, hotel lobby or anywhere supplemental heat and ambiance is needed. Touch screen buttons together with remote control enable convenient user experience, no matter using it in winter for warm heating or other seasons for decorating. ☀【Efficient Two Heat Settings】: Upper front heater blower (vent at the top). Two heat settings (high 1500W and low 750W) can heat up to 400 square feet room quite nicely. The thermostat can control the room temperature from 60℉ to 97℉ to suit user's preference. The countdown timer can be set to turn off the fireplace up to 12 hours. ☀【Realistic Flame Effect】: Ultra High Intensity LED lights provide very bright and realistic flame effect. Two options for ember bed: Log set or crystal stones to meet your need. 9 different flame color settings cater to your desired ambience. The flame effect can be operated with or without heat for year-round ambience. 5 color intensities to control brightness from bright to dim. ☀【Safe and Energy Saving】: Use LED technology instead of gas or oil, save time and energy as this fireplace produces no messy or harmful things, safe for people and pets. And the Homedex fireplace is CSA certificated and equipped with safety cut-off device for overheat protection. The heat maintains the natural humidity in the air, which will not make the room too dry. ☀【In-wall/Wall-hung Installation】: This electric fireplace is specially created for in-wall recessed mounting. Second choice: wall-hung mounted. Just plug in 110V outlet and enjoy. Please contact our customer service team if you have questions about installation, damage or missing parts.The working frequency of remote is close to vizio tv, please thought about it before bought if you have vizio tv.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LII6p81QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homedex","source_asin":"B0BJSYJW5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJSYJW5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJSYJW5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
