window.products.push({"id":864669,"name":"Set of 3 Authentic Mexican Woven Cloth Napkins (servilletas mexicanas) 100% Cotton for Tortilla Warmer (Tortillero), Dish Towels (secadores), Placemat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VMfayxjtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These set of 3 traditional Mexican woven napkins made of 100% cotton are a great way to give a hint of color and personality to parties and get-togethers. Perfect to give a Mexican touch to your table, kitchen and home. You can use them for everything! As napkins, placemats, in your tortilla warmer (tortillero), as a basket cloth, etc. Wrap your warm tortillas, pancakes, pita bread, arepas, naan, chips, etc. Great supplies and decorations for your next “south of the border” party, Taco Tuesday dinner, Cinco de Mayo, birthday, quinceanera (quinceañera), wedding, baptism, First Communion, Day of the Death (Día de Muertos) and any other Mexican themed fiesta or celebration. Enjoy them with people you love! They are a great gift. Anyone that wants to embrace a piece of Mexican culture will adore them! Our premium napkins measure approximately 19.5” x 16”. Due to their craftsmanship measurement and color may vary slightly. Mexicandoo contributes with just payment to artisans so they can receive a fair source of income to continue doing what they love. Set de 3 preciosas y autenticas servilletas mexicanas hechas 100% de algodón. Se pueden usar de diferentes maneras: como servilletas, manteles individuales, en el tortillero, etc. Son perfectas para darle el toque mexicano a tu mesa, cocina y hogar. Envuelve tus tortillas en estas servilletas para mantenerlas calientes tal y como acostumbramos en México y ponlas en tu tortillero favorito. Regala un pedazo de México a tus seres queridos y a cualquier persona que aprecie nuestra cultura. Las servilletas miden aproximadamente 50 x 40 cms. Por su proceso artesanal puede haber una ligera variación en el tamaño y color de las servilletas. Mexicandoo es parte de la campaña “no al regateo” que busca un pago justo para los artesanos de México.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VMfayxjtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEXICANDOO","source_asin":"B07RLJ7SB9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RLJ7SB9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RLJ7SB9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
