window.products.push({"id":864892,"name":"Professional Knife Sharpener, 2 Stage Knife Sharpener, 2 Stage Diamond Coated Sharpening Wheel System, By Kitchen Knacks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FVVqKNm3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"THE ULTIMATE KITCHEN SHARPENER Sharpen Like Pro at The Convenience of Your Kitchen Are you sick and tired of using dull and blunt knives that make preparing your favorite meals a daunting exercise? And are you looking for the best kitchen knife sharpener to ease your kitchen cutting experience? Well, if yes your search ends here thanks to this premium quality stainless steel knife sharpener. You will never have to deal with dull knives in your kitchen again. This professional knife sharpener will always get the job done. Our kitchen knife sharpener features a unique 2-STAGE SHARPENING design for quick, safe and convenient sharpening of your dull knives. Stage 1 reshapes the angle, sharpens and rejuvenates the edge of your knife, while Stage 2 finishes the sharpening process honing and polishing the blade. It will keep any straight edge steel knives constantly sharp and polished. Your kitchen should' t be without it! Effortless, Convenient Sharpening Experience Always This 2-stage knife sharpener comes with a non-slip cushioned base that prevents slips and an ergonomic handle, making knife sharpening a comfortable, easier and safe exercise. How to Use Place the knife sharpener on a flat surface With one hand hold the knife sharpener by the stainless steel rod. For a very blunt knife, hold it by the handle and pull it along the coarse slot toward you 2 to 4 times to rejuvenate the edge. Move the knife to the fine slot and pull it toward you 2 to 4 times or until sharpness as desired. This is to polish the blade off and to hone the knife. Here Is Why This Knife Sharpener Is the Best Buy Saves your money by putting your old dull knives into perfect cutting condition Durable ABS plastic with Diamond Coated Sharpening Wheel System ergonomic handle for a comfortable and easy sharpening experience  2 stage sharpening design- sharpens and polishes your knife Trusted and vouched by professional chefs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FVVqKNm3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Knacks","source_asin":"B0745JN4HB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-864892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0745JN4HB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0745JN4HB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
